{"id": "3327529", "name": "אינטגרלים משולשים – קואורדינטות כדוריות", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "none", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_Q8_CLEAR_SPH_V1\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">אינטגרל משולש בקואורדינטות כדוריות</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div>יהי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle E\\)</span> הגוף הבא</div>\n[[if test=\"{{CT:3}}\"]]\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 18px; margin: 8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle x^2+y^2+z^2\\le{{CT:0}}\\)</div>\n[[/if]] [[if test=\"{{CT:4}}\"]]\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 18px; margin: 8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:1}}\\le x^2+y^2+z^2\\le{{CT:0}}\\)</div>\n[[/if]] [[if test=\"{{CT:5}}\"]]\n<div>בנוסף מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle y\\ge0\\)</span>.</div>\n[[/if]] [[if test=\"{{CT:6}}\"]]\n<div>בנוסף מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle x\\ge0,\\ y\\ge0\\)</span>.</div>\n[[/if]] [[if test=\"{{CT:7}}\"]]\n<div>בנוסף מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle z\\ge0\\)</span>.</div>\n[[/if]] [[if test=\"{{CT:8}}\"]]\n<div>בנוסף מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle z\\ge\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}\\)</span>.</div>\n[[/if]] [[if test=\"{{CT:9}}\"]]\n<div>בנוסף מתקיים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle \\sqrt{3}z\\ge\\sqrt{x^2+y^2}\\)</span>.</div>\n[[/if]]\n<div style=\"margin-top: 8px;\">חשבו את האינטגרל</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 19px; margin: 8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle I=\\iiint_E {{CT:2}}\\,dV\\)</div>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 8px;\">השתמשו בקואורדינטות כדוריות</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px; margin: 8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle x=\\rho\\sin\\varphi\\cos\\theta,\\qquad y=\\rho\\sin\\varphi\\sin\\theta,\\qquad z=\\rho\\cos\\varphi \\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px; margin: 8px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle J=\\rho^2\\sin\\varphi\\)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">א. כתיבת האינטגרל במשתנים החדשים</div>\n<div>כתבו את האינטגרל בצורה</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 18px; margin: 8px 0 12px 0;\">\\(\\displaystyle I= \\int_a^b \\int_c^d \\int_e^f G(\\rho,\\varphi,\\theta)\\,d\\rho\\,d\\varphi\\,d\\theta \\)</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(210px,330px)); gap: 11px; justify-content: center; align-items: start;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 11px 13px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle a=\\)[[input:ans3]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans3]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 11px 13px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle b=\\)[[input:ans4]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans4]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 11px 13px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle c=\\)[[input:ans5]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans5]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 11px 13px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle d=\\)[[input:ans6]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans6]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 11px 13px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle e=\\)[[input:ans1]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans1]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 11px 13px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle f=\\)[[input:ans2]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans2]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; text-align: center; margin-top: 9px;\">כלומר: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a,b\\)</span> הם גבולות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\theta\\)</span>, <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(c,d\\)</span> הם גבולות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>, ו־<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(e,f\\)</span> הם גבולות <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\rho\\)</span>.</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f; margin-bottom: 10px;\">ב. האינטגרנד החדש והתוצאה</div>\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 10px;\">כאן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(G(\\rho,\\varphi,\\theta)\\)</span> הוא האינטגרנד לאחר ההצבה, <strong>כולל</strong> היעקוביאן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(J=\\rho^2\\sin\\varphi\\)</span>.</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(240px,390px)); gap: 12px; justify-content: center; align-items: start;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 11px 13px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle G(\\rho,\\varphi,\\theta)=\\)[[input:ans7]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans7]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #F8F7F9; border: 1px solid #E4DEE7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 11px 13px;\">\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center; gap: 8px; white-space: nowrap;\">\\(\\displaystyle I=\\)[[input:ans8]]</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #665f6b; margin-top: 5px;\">[[validation:ans8]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"width: 100%; font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right;\" title=\"BGU_STACK_CALC2_CHANGEVARS_V1\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #4b1f6f;\">פתרון מלא</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #fff; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n<p>בהתאם להגדרת הקואורדינטות בשאלה מתקבלים הגבולות</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:10}}\\le\\rho\\le{{CT:11}},\\quad {{CT:12}}\\le\\theta\\le{{CT:13}},\\quad {{CT:14}}\\le\\varphi\\le{{CT:15}}\\)</div>\n<p>היעקוביאן הוא <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\displaystyle \\rho^2\\sin\\varphi\\)</span>, ולכן האינטגרנד לאחר ההחלפה הוא</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:16}}\\)</div>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 17px; margin-top: 8px;\">\\(\\displaystyle I=\\int_{{{CT:12}}}^{{{CT:13}}}\\int_{{{CT:14}}}^{{{CT:15}}}\\int_{{{CT:10}}}^{{{CT:11}}}{{CT:16}}\\,d\\rho\\,d\\varphi\\,d\\theta={{CT:17}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<div style=\"display: none;\">[[feedback:prt1]][[feedback:prt2]][[feedback:prt3]][[feedback:prt4]][[feedback:prt5]][[feedback:prt6]][[feedback:prt7]][[feedback:prt8]]</div>", "prtcorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"correct\">תשובה נכונה.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"partially\">חלק מן התשובה נכון. בדקו את שאר הרכיבים.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p dir=\"rtl\"><span class=\"incorrect\">התשובה עדיין אינה נכונה.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 8, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 8, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 8, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 8, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 3, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 1, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans5", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 8, "insertstars": 1, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustv